{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04984","headline":"仪坤庙乐章 · 张齐贤","name":"仪坤庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祼圭既濯，郁鬯既陈。\n画幕云举，黄流玉醇。\n仪充献酌，礼盛衆禋。\n地察惟孝，愉焉飨亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张齐贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}